<title>USA: Penn Traffic names Robert Davis CFO.</title>
<headline>Penn Traffic names Robert Davis CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Penn Traffic Co said Monday it had named Robert Davis chief financial officer and senior vice president of finance.</p>
<p>Davis, who was previously the firm's treasurer, replaces Eugene Sunderhaft who is leaving to pursue other interests, the company said.</p>
